    "turn_text": "They are, you know what, it is, it makes my part a whole lot easier knowing that we've got such a great staff here in the district and in DC. Now you take this district staff at one point, you know, they were working over 200 cases at one time because our federal government had decided, and they still have decided that over one third of the federal government employees don't have to come back into the office to go to work. They're working from home.",
