  {
    "episode_id": 44925,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/4/44925.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Well, Congressman, you, you, uh, really did something yesterday or the day or actually even doing it last couple of days is to grab my attention in a good way. You are doing your very best, uh, to empower the people of Texas to fight for the integrity of their border. And you are drafting legislation, you're working to draft legislation that will enable the state of Texas to continue to maintain their own razor wire and whatever deterrence need to be in place to keep illegal immigrants at bay while the feds are fighting to take every impediment down. Tell us your progress so far and then I'll ask you from there.",
