        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker considers states’ rights to self-protection superior to federal policy in cases of perceived national vulnerability.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the Supreme Court’s alignment with the Biden administration as evidence of institutional bias against state-level border enforcement.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that defunding federal border enforcement would effectively compel compliance with state-led measures.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that public opinion supports strong border enforcement as a core value.",
